  "evidence": "- TEXT_G: Uphold Human Rights Act/ECHR; proportional representation and votes at 16; scrap voter ID; rebuild EU ties and seek long‑term Single Market membership; end Hostile Environment, scrap Illegal Migration Act/Rwanda plan, expand safe/legal routes and right to work after 3 months; reduce detention with a 28‑day limit; ban conversion practices; classify misogyny as a hate crime; strong environmental measures including airport expansion moratorium and bans on fracking/coal.\n- TEXT_F: Legal annual cap on work/family visas that falls each year; Rwanda removals with monthly flights and tougher asylum/returns; tougher sentencing, four new prisons, expanded foreign national offender removals; new protest restrictions (face coverings/pyrotechnics, ban protests outside schools); National Service at 18; define sex in law as biological sex and single legal sex; defence to 2.5% GDP; maintain sovereignty focus in EU relations; reverse London ULEZ expansion and ‘Backing Drivers’ bill; North Sea oil and gas licensing and new gas plants.",
